&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BREEZE&lt;/strong&gt; by Lattafa — 100 ML&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An enchanting and harmonious unisex fragrance that combines exquisite notes to create a scent evoking serenity and sophistication. Breeze opens with the bright freshness of bergamot, incense, and cardamom — crisp and immediately captivating. The heart reveals lily of the valley and cyclamen — delicate, clean, and effortlessly elegant. The base settles into musk, sandalwood, and cedarwood — warm, smooth, and beautifully lasting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fragrance Notes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Top: Bergamot, Incense, Cardamom&lt;br&gt;
Heart: Lily of the Valley, Cyclamen&lt;br&gt;
Base: Musk, Sandalwood, Cedarwood&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Size:&lt;/strong&gt; 100 ML &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Eau de Parfum &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;For:&lt;/strong&gt; Unisex&lt;/p&gt;
